# Automated Governance via Agentic AI Code Reviews

## Architectural Strategy Overview
To optimize review cycle speeds across expansive documentation updates, this project integrates an automated **Agentic AI Code Review Check** into our DevOps repository ecosystem. 

When a writer opens a Pull Request, an autonomous workflow instance executes custom programmatic checks to lint text patterns, score readability, and ensure style guide compliance before a human editor steps in.

